  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Against Giant Spectral Soul, Demon Immortal Qi Jue finishes preparing the immortal killer move while Lu Wei Yin stalls the fight. Xi Land above his head shines with profound light aimed at Spectral Soul; the light pillar drains black soul qi from Giant Spectral Soul’s body, shrinking that form and weakening Spectral Soul’s soul path methods.",
      "chapters": [
        2055
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_demon_immortal_qi_jue",
        "sys_killer_moves",
        "char_lu_wei_yin",
        "loc_xi_land"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan later treats that cast as the turning point of the battle after Lu Wei Yin’s defense bought Qi Jue the time to finish it.",
      "chapters": [
        2058
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When legendary immemorial beasts pin Rising Cloud City, Qi Jue summons Xi Land’s silhouette and activates Xi Xi. Xi Land erupts with attraction force and absorbs the qi ring around the house’s surface, restoring the house’s freedom.",
      "chapters": [
        2179
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "house-freed",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "house_rising_cloud_city"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Facing Seven Fiendish Primeval Monarch and Shabi Ninety-five with a damaged Xi Land phantom overhead, Qi Jue uses Xi Xi as his strongest method. Shabi Ninety-five’s qi path killer move is absorbed into Xi Land and increases Qi Jue’s foundation; only about thirty percent of Xi Land remains, or parts of the beast’s body would have been devoured as well.",
      "chapters": [
        2191
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "qi-attack-absorbed",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_seven_fiendish_primeval_monarch",
        "char_shabi_ninety_five"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Qi Jue furiously activates Xi Xi again and suppresses Seven Fiendish Primeval Monarch; with Shen Shang’s coordinated attack that Immortal dies after a few breaths, and Shabi Ninety-five is cut in two.",
      "chapters": [
        2198
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
